---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout
	title="Privacy Policy - PlateUp"
	description="Privacy Policy for the PlateUp mobile application and services."
>
	<!-- Navigation Header -->
	<header class="navbar">
		<div class="container nav-container">
			<a href="/" class="brand">
				<img src="/logo.png" alt="PlateUp Logo" class="brand-logo" />
				<span class="brand-text">Plate<span class="brand-accent">Up</span></span>
			</a>

			<nav class="nav-links">
				<a href="/">← Back to Home</a>
			</nav>

			<div class="nav-cta">
				<a href="/app-release.apk" class="btn btn-primary btn-sm" download>
					Download APK
				</a>
			</div>
		</div>
	</header>

	<main class="privacy-page">
		<div class="container">
			<div class="privacy-header">
				<span class="badge">Legal & Security</span>
				<h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
				<p class="updated-date">Last Updated: October 20, 2026</p>
			</div>

			<article class="privacy-card glass-card">
				<section class="policy-section">
					<h2>1. Introduction</h2>
					<p>
						Welcome to <strong>PlateUp</strong> ("we", "our", or "us"). We respect your privacy and are committed to protecting any personal information you share with us through the PlateUp mobile application and related web services.
					</p>
					<p>
						This Privacy Policy describes what information we collect, how it is stored and protected, and what rights you have regarding your personal data.
					</p>
				</section>

				<section class="policy-section">
					<h2>2. Information We Collect</h2>
					<p>We only collect information necessary to provide you with seamless meal planning, recipe cataloging, and pantry tracking services:</p>
					<ul>
						<li>
							<strong>Account Information:</strong> When you register for PlateUp, we may collect your username, email address, and encrypted authentication credentials.
						</li>
						<li>
							<strong>User Generated Content:</strong> Custom recipes, dietary preferences, scheduled meal plans, pantry inventory lists, and shopping lists that you create inside the app.
						</li>
						<li>
							<strong>Media Uploads:</strong> Photos you optionally choose to upload for your custom recipes or profile avatar, stored securely via Cloudinary.
						</li>
						<li>
							<strong>Technical & Device Data:</strong> Basic application telemetry, such as app version and crash logs, used solely for performance optimization and debugging.
						</li>
					</ul>
				</section>

				<section class="policy-section">
					<h2>3. How We Use Your Information</h2>
					<p>We use the data collected strictly for the following purposes:</p>
					<ul>
						<li>To deliver, maintain, and synchronize your meal planner across your devices.</li>
						<li>To compile smart shopping checklists based on your chosen recipes and pantry status.</li>
						<li>To authenticate your user sessions securely via JWT tokens.</li>
						<li>To continuously improve application stability, performance, and user experience.</li>
					</ul>
					<p>
						<strong>We never sell, rent, or trade your personal data to third parties or advertising networks.</strong>
					</p>
				</section>

				<section class="policy-section">
					<h2>4. Data Storage and Security</h2>
					<p>
						We implement modern industry-standard security safeguards. Passwords are cryptographically hashed using <code>bcrypt</code>, API communications are encrypted via HTTPS/TLS, and media files are stored on secure cloud storage infrastructure.
					</p>
				</section>

				<section class="policy-section">
					<h2>5. Offline & Local Storage</h2>
					<p>
						PlateUp caches meal plans and shopping checklists locally on your device to enable offline access. This data remains on your physical device and can be cleared at any time by clearing the application cache or uninstalling the app.
					</p>
				</section>

				<section class="policy-section">
					<h2>6. Your Rights & Data Deletion</h2>
					<p>You have full ownership of your data. At any time, you can:</p>
					<ul>
						<li>View, update, or edit your recipes, meal plans, and profile details.</li>
						<li>Request the complete deletion of your account and associated cloud data.</li>
					</ul>
				</section>

				<section class="policy-section">
					<h2>7. Third-Party Services</h2>
					<p>
						PlateUp utilizes select trusted third-party providers strictly for functional cloud features:
					</p>
					<ul>
						<li><strong>Cloudinary:</strong> For secure image upload and hosting of recipe photos.</li>
						<li><strong>MongoDB Atlas:</strong> For cloud-hosted, encrypted database storage.</li>
					</ul>
				</section>

				<section class="policy-section">
					<h2>8. Contact Us</h2>
					<p>
						If you have any questions, feedback, or requests regarding this Privacy Policy or your data, please reach out via GitHub:
					</p>
					<p>
						<a href="https://github.com/jlinares30/PlateUp-app-mobile" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="contact-link">
							👉 Visit GitHub Repository / Issues
						</a>
					</p>
				</section>
			</article>
		</div>
	</main>

	<!-- Footer -->
	<footer class="footer">
		<div class="container footer-bottom">
			<p>&copy; {new Date().getFullYear()} PlateUp. Built with passion by Jorge Linares.</p>
		</div>
	</footer>
</Layout>

<style>
	/* Header / Navigation */
	.navbar {
		position: sticky;
		top: 0;
		z-index: 100;
		background: rgba(9, 11, 14, 0.85);
		backdrop-filter: blur(16px);
		-webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(16px);
		border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.07);
		padding: 0.9rem 0;
	}

	.nav-container {
		display: flex;
		align-items: center;
		justify-content: space-between;
	}

	.brand {
		display: flex;
		align-items: center;
		gap: 0.75rem;
		text-decoration: none;
	}

	.brand-logo {
		width: 36px;
		height: 36px;
		object-fit: contain;
	}

	.brand-text {
		font-family: var(--font-heading);
		font-size: 1.45rem;
		font-weight: 800;
		letter-spacing: -0.03em;
		color: #ffffff;
	}

	.brand-accent {
		color: var(--color-primary-light);
	}

	.nav-links a {
		font-size: 0.95rem;
		color: var(--color-text-muted);
		font-weight: 500;
		transition: color 0.2s;
	}

	.nav-links a:hover {
		color: var(--color-primary-light);
	}

	.btn-sm {
		padding: 0.55rem 1.15rem;
		font-size: 0.88rem;
	}

	/* Privacy Page */
	.privacy-page {
		padding: 4rem 0 6rem;
		position: relative;
	}

	.privacy-header {
		text-align: center;
		max-width: 720px;
		margin: 0 auto 3rem;
	}

	.privacy-header h1 {
		font-size: clamp(2.4rem, 4vw, 3.2rem);
		font-weight: 800;
		margin-top: 1rem;
		margin-bottom: 0.6rem;
	}

	.updated-date {
		color: var(--color-text-dim);
		font-size: 0.95rem;
	}

	.privacy-card {
		max-width: 820px;
		margin: 0 auto;
		padding: 3rem;
		background: rgba(17, 20, 26, 0.75);
		border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
	}

	.policy-section {
		margin-bottom: 2.4rem;
	}

	.policy-section:last-child {
		margin-bottom: 0;
	}

	.policy-section h2 {
		font-size: 1.35rem;
		font-weight: 700;
		color: var(--color-primary-light);
		margin-bottom: 1rem;
		border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05);
		padding-bottom: 0.4rem;
	}

	.policy-section p {
		color: var(--color-text-muted);
		font-size: 1rem;
		line-height: 1.7;
		margin-bottom: 0.9rem;
	}

	.policy-section ul {
		margin-left: 1.5rem;
		margin-bottom: 1rem;
		color: var(--color-text-muted);
		display: flex;
		flex-direction: column;
		gap: 0.6rem;
		line-height: 1.6;
	}

	.policy-section li strong {
		color: #ffffff;
	}

	.policy-section code {
		background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
		padding: 0.2rem 0.45rem;
		border-radius: 4px;
		font-size: 0.88rem;
		color: var(--color-primary-light);
	}

	.contact-link {
		color: var(--color-primary-light);
		font-weight: 600;
		text-decoration: underline;
		text-underline-offset: 4px;
	}

	.contact-link:hover {
		color: #ffffff;
	}

	/* Footer */
	.footer {
		border-top: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.06);
		padding: 2.5rem 0;
		background: #08090d;
	}

	.footer-bottom {
		text-align: center;
		font-size: 0.85rem;
		color: var(--color-text-dim);
	}

	@media (max-width: 768px) {
		.privacy-card {
			padding: 2rem 1.4rem;
		}
	}
</style>
